## Deploy procedure (CD pipeline — happy path)

CD pipeline uruchamia się automatycznie po push do `main` (jeśli CI PASS). Monitoruj w GitHub Actions.

**Jeśli CD pipeline fail → manual fallback poniżej.**

---

## Manual deploy procedure (fallback przy CD failure)

```bash
# SSH na VPS prod
ssh {{VPS_USER}}@{{VPS_PROD_HOST}}
cd /opt/{{PROJECT_SLUG}}

# 1. Pobierz nowy image (SHA z GitHub Actions artifact lub ręcznie)
export NEW_SHA=$(git ls-remote https://github.com/{{GITHUB_ORG}}/{{PROJECT_SLUG}} HEAD | cut -f1 | head -c12)
docker pull ghcr.io/{{GITHUB_ORG}}/{{PROJECT_SLUG}}:${NEW_SHA}

# 2. Tag jako current candidate
docker tag ghcr.io/{{GITHUB_ORG}}/{{PROJECT_SLUG}}:${NEW_SHA} \
           ghcr.io/{{GITHUB_ORG}}/{{PROJECT_SLUG}}:current-candidate

# 3. Update compose.prod.yml IMAGE tag (sed lub ręcznie)
sed -i "s|image: ghcr.io/{{GITHUB_ORG}}/{{PROJECT_SLUG}}:.*|image: ghcr.io/{{GITHUB_ORG}}/{{PROJECT_SLUG}}:${NEW_SHA}|" compose.prod.yml

# 4. Rolling restart (app tylko, nie db/proxy)
docker compose -f compose.prod.yml up -d app

# 5. Healthcheck verification (10 retries × 3s = 30s max wait)
HEALTHY=false
for i in {1..10}; do
  STATUS=$(curl -sf http://localhost:{{APP_PORT}}/api/ready 2>/dev/null | jq -r .status 2>/dev/null)
  if [ "$STATUS" = "ok" ]; then
    echo "HEALTHY after ${i} attempts (${i}x3s)"
    HEALTHY=true
    break
  fi
  echo "Attempt $i: status=$STATUS, waiting 3s..."
  sleep 3
done

# 6. Jeśli unhealthy → ROLLBACK (patrz poniżej)
if [ "$HEALTHY" != "true" ]; then
  echo "DEPLOY FAILED — initiating rollback"
  # patrz sekcja Rollback procedure
fi

# 7. Weryfikacja wersji
curl -sf http://localhost:{{APP_PORT}}/api/version | jq .
# Oczekiwany output: {"version":"x.y.z","sha":"{{SHA12}}","env":"production"}

# 8. Sentry check — zero nowych unhandled errors w 5 min
echo "Monitor Sentry dashboard for 5 minutes: https://sentry.io/organizations/{{SENTRY_ORG}}/projects/{{SENTRY_PROJECT}}/"
```

