## Healthcheck verification post-deploy

```bash
# 1. Liveness
curl -sf http://localhost:{{APP_PORT}}/api/health
# Expected: {"status":"ok","uptime":42}

# 2. Readiness (DB ping)
curl -sf http://localhost:{{APP_PORT}}/api/ready
# Expected: {"status":"ok","db":"connected","migrations":"up-to-date"}

# 3. Version (SHA verification)
curl -sf http://localhost:{{APP_PORT}}/api/version
# Expected: {"version":"x.y.z","sha":"<12-char SHA>","env":"production"}

# 4. Caddy TLS (zewnętrzny)
curl -sf https://{{PROD_DOMAIN}}/api/ready
# Expected: identyczny jak wewnętrzny + brak TLS errors

# 5. UptimeRobot ping (2-5 min po deploy)
# Sprawdź dashboard: https://uptimerobot.com/dashboard
# Status: UP (zielony) — jeśli DOWN: błąd healthchecku nie był wykryty lokalnie

# 6. Sentry — zero nowych errors w 5 min post-deploy
# Dashboard: https://sentry.io/organizations/{{SENTRY_ORG}}/projects/{{SENTRY_PROJECT}}/
```

