## Self-hosted runner maintenance

```bash
# Sprawdź status runnera
systemctl status github-runner

# Restart runnera (po aktualizacji lub crash)
sudo systemctl restart github-runner

# Logi runnera
journalctl -u github-runner -n 50 --no-pager

# Update runnera (quarterly)
cd /home/github-runner/actions-runner
./config.sh remove --token {{RUNNER_REMOVAL_TOKEN}}
# Pobierz nową wersję z https://github.com/actions/runner/releases
# Skonfiguruj na nowo: ./config.sh --url https://github.com/{{GITHUB_ORG}}/{{PROJECT_SLUG}} --token {{NEW_TOKEN}}
sudo ./svc.sh install && sudo ./svc.sh start
```
